      "properties": {},
      "title": "H3 Steady Lab — how to connect it",
      "widgets_values": [
        "H3 Steady Lab aims to reduce generation failures in MiniMax H3 videos. It is not a general quality enhancer.\n\nInsert it in the MODEL path before sampling. In this example, its output feeds both BasicGuider and BasicScheduler.\n\nNon-Turbo starting point: Strength 1–2, Step 0 = 0.\nTurbo starting point: Strength 3, Step 0 = 0.10–0.20. Keep your Turbo model and sampling setup.\n\nThis example uses non-Turbo settings: er_sde / beta / 20 steps. Select your installed model files before running."
      ]
    }
